{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1786916920295312001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"stumpy-cinnabar-basenji","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"6cc9ee89d6d070de38a0f756c032f87fefa22649ca5af45fe7c978bcb9231000","event_uuid":"f2c973f5-6151-4df7-a3d5-d181d307badc","position":{"commit_sha":"d43e6bdbbe496db472eb819a9d2ea5c1bfa46ce4","position":"1786914861739893001-f2c973f5-6151-4df7-a3d5-d181d307badc"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"92c0f0df225bf4fae3df5dff3dec7a057f2b5ab5992f174a255c06ed78c67cfc","event_uuid":"4c410eaa-aa6a-4b00-b206-eb89e44e4ed6","position":{"commit_sha":"837fac7957e60175adf4a6dd4117a7748b8f677c","position":"1786914884039062001-4c410eaa-aa6a-4b00-b206-eb89e44e4ed6"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1786914861739893001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"4c410eaa-aa6a-4b00-b206-eb89e44e4ed6","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"0024-fa99-d5bb-49bc"}],"description":"## Context\nThe CI-equivalent default suite passes but 13 grounding tests emit `DeprecationWarning` from Python's `multiprocessing/popen_fork.py`: the process is multi-threaded and use of `fork()` may lead to deadlocks in the child. The warnings arise in `tests/unit/grounding/test_conformance.py` and `tests/unit/grounding/test_harness.py` under xdist worker execution.\n\n## Reproduction\nRun the default suite with `-n 4 --dist worksteal` and warnings enabled; the warning is emitted repeatedly while grounding harness subprocess tests execute.\n\n## Plan\nUse rebar-debug to trace the exact process-creation path and distinguish production harness behavior from test-only multiprocessing setup. Prove the root cause under a deterministic warning-as-error oracle before changing start methods or subprocess semantics. Any cross-platform process-model change requires explicit behavior review.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] A deterministic focused reproduction identifies the exact fork call path and owning code.\n- [ ] The affected grounding tests pass with this warning class promoted to an error.\n- [ ] The repair preserves timeout, cleanup, and child-process isolation contracts across supported platforms.\n- [ ] Focused concurrency tests and repository gates pass.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["warning","grounding","concurrency"],"ticket_id":"5701-5e57-2e94-4b17","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Grounding harness tests fork from multithreaded workers and warn about deadlock risk","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["f2c973f5-6151-4df7-a3d5-d181d307badc","4c410eaa-aa6a-4b00-b206-eb89e44e4ed6"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786916920295312001,"uuid":"7754a6c2-4992-4ddf-b9c8-fec0ba6eebea"}